# Dashboard (MVP)

Command center for Ranches Thunders — summarize, do not manage.

## Purpose

Within ~5 seconds show:

- Next weekend match(es) as a dominant **match ticket** (`MatchTicket`)
- Poll status (availability / carpool counts vs 11–12)
- Pending payments
- Team fund balance
- Recent notifications
- Admin quick actions (create match, add expense, ask contribution) as secondary chips

## Widgets (MVP)

- Next match ticket (`#082417` clubhouse surface)
- Availability strength
- Carpool summary
- Pending weekend payments
- Team fund balance
- Notifications
- Quick actions (role-aware, never competing with the ticket)

## Rules

- Widgets load independently via query hooks
- No Supabase in widgets
- Loading / empty / error / success on every widget
- Mobile stack; desktop grid
- No large management tables on Home
- Prefer a compact status rail over equal-weight card grids
- **Admin-only** team snapshot rail: carpool riders, unpaid weekend fees, team fund balance
- Players do not see the Admin status rail (they use match tickets + Payments for their own fees)
- Render **one ticket per weekend day** (Sat and/or Sun) — never collapse a weekend to a single fixture
- Home sections: **This weekend** then **More upcoming matches** (later weekends)
- Tickets respect `polls_enabled` — voting only when confirmed and polls are on
- Home reads `useDashboardSnapshot()`; weekend scoping is service logic, not JSX filtering
- Each confirmed-match ticket provides real one-tap availability + travel voting
- Poll buttons mutate in place; only the dedicated arrow navigates to match detail
